2026-09-12T17:23:20.8803700Z ==> ccache
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8804760Z To install symlinks for compilers that will automatically use
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8805600Z ccache, prepend this directory to your PATH:
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8806220Z   /opt/homebrew/opt/ccache/libexec
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8806450Z 
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8806790Z If this is an upgrade and you have previously added the symlinks to
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8807500Z your PATH, you may need to modify it to the path specified above so
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8808100Z it points to the current version.
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8808390Z 
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8808640Z NOTE: ccache can prevent some software from compiling.
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8809090Z ALSO NOTE: The brew command, by design, will never use ccache.
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8809580Z ==> jack
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8810000Z To start jack now and restart at login:
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8810310Z   brew services start jack
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8810720Z Or, if you don't want/need a background service you can just run:
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8811570Z   /opt/homebrew/opt/jack/bin/jackd -X coremidi -d coreaudio
2026-09-12T17:23:20.8812020Z ==> stk
